  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>The AI Revolution: Three Parallel Tracks</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Research breakthroughs, industry adoption, and regulatory response across 2010–2025</p>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <p><strong>ChatGPT changed everything.</strong> In the 14 months after November 2022, we saw the Biden Executive Order, EU AI Act agreement, and Bletchley Declaration — a policy response that would normally take years compressed into months.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="timeline-section">
      <div class="timeline-header">
        <div class="track-legend">
          <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot research"></div>Research</div>
          <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot industry"></div>Industry</div>
          <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot regulation"></div>Regulation</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
          ● critical &nbsp; ● high &nbsp; ● medium significance
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-container">
        <div class="timeline-axis">
          <div class="year-marker">2010</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2012</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2014</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2016</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2018</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2020</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2022</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2024</div>
          <div class="year-marker">2025</div>
        </div>

        <div class="tracks">
          <!-- Research Track -->
          <div class="track research" style="padding-left: 50px;">
            <div class="track-label">Research</div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(2/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2012-09">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>AlexNet (2012)</strong><br>CNN wins ImageNet, 10.8pp better than runner-up. Ignites deep learning revolution.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(4/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2014-06">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GANs (2014)</strong><br>Goodfellow introduces Generative Adversarial Networks.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(4.8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2014-09">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Seq2Seq + Attention</strong><br>Bahdanau attention enables neural machine translation.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(5.9/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2015-12">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>ResNet</strong><br>Residual connections enable 152-layer deep networks. Superhuman on ImageNet.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(7/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2017-06">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Transformer</strong><br>"Attention Is All You Need" — foundation of all modern LLMs.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2018-06">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GPT-1</strong><br>117M params. Unsupervised pre-training + fine-tuning paradigm.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(8.8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2018-10">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>BERT</strong><br>Bidirectional pre-training dominates NLP. Google deploys in Search.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(10/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2020-05">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GPT-3</strong><br>175B params. Few-shot learning without fine-tuning.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(11/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2021-01">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>DALL-E & CLIP</strong><br>Text-to-image and vision-language understanding.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(12.1/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2022-04">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>PaLM</strong><br>540B params. Chain-of-thought reasoning capabilities.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-03">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GPT-4</strong><br>Multimodal LLM passes bar exam (90th percentile).</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(14/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2024-02">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Gemini 1.5</strong><br>Million-token context window enables new paradigms.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(14.6/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2024-09">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>o1 reasoning model</strong><br>Chain-of-thought at inference. PhD-level reasoning.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(15/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2025-02">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Claude 3.5 / GPT-4.5</strong><br>Near-human performance on professional tasks.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Industry Track -->
          <div class="track industry" style="padding-left: 50px;">
            <div class="track-label">Industry</div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(1.8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2011-10">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Siri launches</strong><br>Apple ships first mainstream voice assistant on iPhone 4S.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(4.8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2014-11">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Amazon Echo / Alexa</strong><br>Voice AI enters the home. 100M+ units by 2020.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(6.7/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2016-09">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Google Translate goes neural</strong><br>NMT replaces phrase-based. Quality jumps dramatically.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(8.3/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2018-05">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Google Duplex</strong><br>AI makes phone calls to book appointments.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(10/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2020-06">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GPT-3 API</strong><br>First commercial LLM API. Spawns thousands of AI startups.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(11.5/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2021-06">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GitHub Copilot</strong><br>AI pair programming. 1M+ developers by 2022.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(12.6/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2022-08">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Stable Diffusion</strong><br>Text-to-image open-sourced. Disrupts creative industries.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(12.9/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2022-11">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>ChatGPT</strong><br>100M users in 2 months. Fastest consumer app adoption ever.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13.1/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-02">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Bing + GPT-4</strong><br>AI in search. Triggers Google's "code red."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13.6/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-07">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Meta Llama 2</strong><br>Open-source LLM competitive with proprietary.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(14/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2024-01">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>AI agents enterprise</strong><br>Salesforce, ServiceNow ship AI agent products.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(14.4/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2024-05">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>GPT-4o</strong><br>Real-time multimodal. Voice, vision, text unified.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(15/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2025-01">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>AI coding agents</strong><br>Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot Workspace mainstream.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Regulation Track -->
          <div class="track regulation" style="padding-left: 50px;">
            <div class="track-label">Regulation</div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(6.7/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2016-10">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Obama White House AI Report</strong><br>First major US government AI policy report.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2018-04">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>EU GDPR</strong><br>"Right to explanation" for automated decisions.</div>
