            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(9.3/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2019-04">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>EU AI Ethics Guidelines</strong><br>"Trustworthy AI" framework. Non-binding.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(10/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2020-02">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>EU AI White Paper</strong><br>Proposes risk-based regulatory framework.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(11.3/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2021-04">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>EU AI Act proposed</strong><br>First comprehensive AI regulation. Risk-based tiers.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(12.8/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2022-10">
              <div class="milestone-dot medium"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>US AI Bill of Rights</strong><br>White House blueprint. Non-binding.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13.4/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-05">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>EU AI Act agreed</strong><br>Parliament approves with generative AI provisions.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13.6/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-07">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>White House commitments</strong><br>7 AI companies sign safety commitments.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(13.9/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-10">
              <div class="milestone-dot critical"></div>
              <div class="milestone-tooltip"><strong>Biden Executive Order</strong><br>Safety testing, watermarking, federal use standards.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone" style="left: calc(14/15 * 100% + 12px);" data-date="2023-11">
              <div class="milestone-dot high"></div>
